{
  "slug": "shipyard",
  "name": "Shipyard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn your idea into working code — Shipyard runs Claude Code through a spec-driven agile sprint lifecycle: discuss features, plan sprints, build with strict TDD, review with adversarial multi-agent code review, and ship. State lives in a per-project plugin-data directory that is worktree-aware and cross-platform (macOS, Linux, Windows). Includes 12 commands, 6 specialized review agents, an investigator, and shipyard-logcap (a tee-and-rotate primitive that captures live verification commands so the orchestrator can re-analyze output without re-running).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **32 skills**, **7 agents** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (32): `acquiring-skill-lock` (Acquire a per-project lock for the current skill), `anti-stub-scan` (Scan a diff for stub patterns and TODO markers), `authoring-acceptance-probe` (Author a runnable acceptance probe from criteria), `discovering-edge-cases` (Discover edge cases and adversarial inputs), `dispatching-code-review` (Dispatch a fresh-context code review subagent), `dispatching-gap-analysis` (Dispatch a review gap-analysis subagent), `dispatching-operational-task` (Dispatch a Shipyard operational task subagent), `dispatching-research-task` (Dispatch a Shipyard research task subagent), and 24 more\n- **Agents** (7): `shipyard-code-reviewer` (Read-only code-quality reviewer for a Shipyard task/wave/feature/sprint diff), `shipyard-disciplined-builder` (TDD-disciplined implementer for one Shipyard feature task in an isolated worktree), `shipyard-gap-analyst` (Read-only gap analyst for Shipyard review), `shipyard-operational-task` (Runs a Shipyard operational task's verify command to a green exit code, fixing in-scope findings and filing out-of-scope…), `shipyard-researcher` (Investigates a Shipyard research task and produces one markdown findings doc with a concrete, evidence-backed recommendation), `shipyard-spec-reviewer` (Read-only spec-compliance reviewer for a Shipyard task/wave/feature/sprint scope), `shipyard-track-coordinator` (Coordinates nested per-task builders for one Shipyard feature track within a single wave — dispatches `shipyard-disciplined-builder` sequentially per…)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `PreToolUse`, `WorktreeCreate`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install shipyard@claude-community` from `Acendas/shipyard` (`plugins/shipyard`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 32,
    "agent": 7,
    "hook": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
